        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "Thank you Carl for your knowledge and professionalism,,.   My husband and I went to your store for a queen-sized mattress for our downstairs bedroom we just renovated after the flood,  while walking around the store trying to pick out a mattress,  at my request, we started talking about an adjustable electric bed,.  That morning, we decided to come back home and discuss our options of moving our bed downstairs and buying an adjustable bed for us, upstairs..  Now, 1 week into our New Adjustable bed, we will never regret our decision,  we have been sleeping like babies ever since,,  Again Thank you for everything,,,",
